  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "2. Slice the brioche muffins in half and toast in the oven for 5 minutes.",
    "3. Grill or pan-fry the bratwurst sausages until browned, about 5-7 minutes.",
    "4. Meanwhile, melt the smoked gouda cheese in a saucepan over low heat.",
    "5. Assemble the sandwiches by spreading Dijon mustard on the toasted muffins.",
    "6. Add the sliced bratwurst, caramelized onions, sauerkraut, and melted gouda cheese.",
    "7. Top with chopped parsley and a pinch of salt and pepper.",
    "8. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
